7446a519d2976ca"]},{"id":"wufan-m-a4e429ad2b7f24037cc2","kind":"mention","text":"裴松之反驳孙盛论赵达","evidence":["wufan-q-b10642f71089ee702642"]},{"id":"wufan-m-89952bdbe37a42f5f5d9","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：河南人","evidence":["wufan-q-a6273d7dcf31cfca0c5b"]},{"id":"wufan-m-5bfba02f1ea8282e3e72","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：用思精密","evidence":["wufan-q-c2a6a66b49d7207889d9"]},{"id":"wufan-m-74f12b583ea942dcf3e5","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：治九宫一算之术，究其微旨","evidence":["wufan-q-31df05a6fb4c72d721cf"]},{"id":"wufan-m-e548236e143476677eb3","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：能应机立成，对问若神；至计飞蝗，射隐伏，无不中效","evidence":["wufan-q-44912a209eaba77eabaf"]},{"id":"wufan-m-c3a166f60658dfadd263","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：其精微若是","evidence":["wufan-q-779857b8612256e8ed6d"]},{"id":"wufan-m-869b5ac93bdb14d9c341","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：宝惜其术","evidence":["wufan-q-83df222270ee639c29fa"]},{"id":"wufan-m-33e93b0eb021bb8a196c","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：自言先人得此术，欲图为帝王师；至仕来三世，不过太史郎","evidence":["wufan-q-203735ee18b7cd876f91"]},{"id":"wufan-m-0629824f50ca90253672","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：言其术微妙，头乘尾除，一算之法，父子不相语","evidence":["wufan-q-11db2729e7a423e4a544"]},{"id":"wufan-m-baa3ce174379a352a23f","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：孙权行师征伐，每令达有所推步，皆如其言","evidence":["wufan-q-5ef6fd7705956d872faa"]},{"id":"wufan-m-893d5c8ad9571302c542","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：常笑谓诸星气风术者曰：当回算帷幕，不出户牖以知天道，而反昼夜暴露以望气祥，不亦难乎","evidence":["wufan-q-4f2edb216c153bdf934f"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-6c71787d582757066a4d","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-ffa00a8bed2586642de8","layer":"original","quote":"后魏文帝大出，有渡江之志。盛建计从建业筑围〖9〗，作薄落〖10〗；围上设假楼，江中浮船。诸将以为无益，盛不听，固立之。文帝到广陵，望围愕然，弥漫数百里；而江水盛长，便引军退：诸将乃伏","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":312,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":91},{"id":"wufan-q-11db2729e7a423e4a544","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-17ba6052b150008390fd","layer":"original","quote":"且此术微妙，头乘尾除，一算之法，父子不相语","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":57,"end":78},{"id":"wufan-q-203735ee18b7cd876f91","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-17ba6052b150008390fd","layer":"original","quote":"吾先人得此术，欲图为帝王师；至仕来三世，不过太史郎","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":49},{"id":"wufan-q-2a83d49bf76cc1ed797a","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-17ba6052b150008390fd","layer":"original","quote":"滕他日赍酒具〖15〗，候颜色，拜跪而请。达曰：“吾先人得此术，欲图为帝王师；至仕来三世，不过太史郎：诚不欲复传之！且此术微妙，头乘尾除，一算之法，父子不相语。然以子笃好不倦，今真以相授矣。”","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":95},{"id":"wufan-q-31df05a6fb4c72d721cf","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-b1c1bc08a69e5ae5e3e0","layer":"original","quote":"治九宫一算之术〖2〗，究其微旨","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":45,"end":60},{"id":"wufan-q-44912a209eaba77eabaf","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-b1c1bc08a69e5ae5e3e0","layer":"original","quote":"是以能应机立成，对问若神；至计飞蝗〖3〗，射隐伏〖4〗，无不中效","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":61,"end":93},{"id":"wufan-q-4a8bcc4c97dcefa66835","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-17ba6052b150008390fd","layer":"original","quote":"滕他日赍酒具〖15〗，候颜色，拜跪而请。达曰：“吾先人得此术，欲图为帝王师；至仕来三世，不过太史郎：诚不欲复传之！且此术微妙，头乘尾除，一算之法，父子不相语。然以子笃好不倦，今真以相授矣。”饮酒数行〖16〗，达起取素书两卷〖17〗，大如手指。达曰：“当写读此，则自解也。吾久废，不复省之〖18〗。今欲思论一过〖19〗，数日当以相与。”","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":167},{"id":"wufan-q-4df1f90da51c7d7f4205","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-5594b8fa211989854fd8","layer":"original","quote":"初，孙权行师征伐，每令达有所推步〖1〗，皆如其言。权问其法，达终不语；由此见薄，禄位不至。﹝一﹞","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"wufan-q-4f2edb216c153bdf934f","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-609dd9a43bcf68e7d854","layer":"original","quote":"达常笑谓诸星气风术者曰〖2〗：“当回算帷幕〖3〗，不出户牖以知天道。而反昼夜暴露，以望气祥〖4〗，不亦难乎！”","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55},{"id":"wufan-q-59aafb134e39766b9cd0","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-00d31326556c44b7cbcb","layer":"original","quote":"间居无为，引算自校〖5〗。乃叹曰：“吾算，讫尽某年月日，其终矣！”达妻数见达效，闻而哭泣。达欲弭妻意，乃更步算〖6〗。言：“向者谬误耳。尚未也！”后如期死。","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":78},{"id":"wufan-q-5ef6fd7705956d872faa","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-5594b8fa211989854fd8","layer":"original","quote":"初，孙权行师征伐，每令达有所推步〖1〗，皆如其言","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"wufan-q-61725732e694c147405d","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-61eba2da0b6189d66d52","layer":"original","quote":"尝过知故〖7〗，知故为之具食。食毕，谓曰：“仓猝乏酒，又无嘉肴；无以叙意，如何？”达因取盘中只箸〖8〗，再三纵横之〖9〗。乃言：“卿东壁下有美酒一斛，又有鹿肉三斤；何以辞无〖10〗？”时坐有他宾，内得主人情。主人惭曰：“以卿善射有无，欲相试耳。竟效如此！”遂出酒，酣饮","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134},{"id":"wufan-q-75ed2a21056f6cf45208","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-301da1de3d18a5b5b588","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：三子各于其术精矣，其用思妙矣；然君子（算）〔等〕役心神〖1〗，宜于大者远者。是以有识之士，舍彼而取此也。﹝一﹞","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58},{"id":"wufan-q-768317446a519d2976ca","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-0b21b08a9dd53e473843","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞孙盛曰：“夫玄览未然，逆鉴来事，虽裨灶、梓慎其犹病诸，况术之下此者乎？吴史书达知东南当有王气，故轻举济江。魏承汉绪，受命中畿；达不能预睹兆萌，而流窜吴越。又不知吝术之鄙，见薄于时；安在其能逆睹天道而审帝王之符瑞哉！昔圣王观天地之文，以画八卦之象；故亹亹成于蓍策，变化形乎六爻；是以三《易》虽殊，卦繇理一。安有回转一筹，可以钩深测隐？意对逆占，而能遂知来物者乎？流俗好异，妄设神奇；不幸之中，仲尼所弃。是以君子志其大者，无所取诸。”","attribution":"孙盛曰","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":115,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fb85abd35bccd57b5d40","start":0,"end":218},{"id":"wufan-q-779857b8612256e8ed6d","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-92878773d27d2587f37e","layer":"original","quote":"其精微若是","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":68,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":41,"end":46},{"id":"wufan-q-83df222270ee639c29fa","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-107c2ef275bd39e731d3","layer":"original","quote":"达宝惜其术","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":5},{"id":"wufan-q-92652a7a47d7f391af9d","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-b1c1bc08a69e5ae5e3e0","layer":"original","quote":"赵达，河南人也〖1〗。少从汉侍中单甫受学，用思精密。谓东南有王者气，可以避难，故脱身渡江。治九宫一算之术〖2〗，究其微旨。是以能应机立成，对问若神；至计飞蝗〖3〗，射隐伏〖4〗，无不中效。","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94},{"id":"wufan-q-963f475f3807703fcdda","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-92878773d27d2587f37e","layer":"original","quote":"又有书简上作千万数〖11〗，著空仓中封之；令达算之。达处如数，云：“但有名无实。”其精微若是。","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":68,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"wufan-q-9d516966fce387f79bec","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-00d31326556c44b7cbcb","layer":"original","quote":"达妻数见达效，闻而哭泣。达欲弭妻意，乃更步算〖6〗。言：“向者谬误耳。尚未也！”","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":33,"end":73},{"id":"wufan-q-a6273d7dcf31cfca0c5b","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-b1c1bc08a69e5ae5e3e0","layer":"original","quote":"赵达，河南人也","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":7},{"id":"wufan-q-b0bb9f2bb1c7b64eb5aa","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-107c2ef275bd39e731d3","layer":"original","quote":"太史丞公孙滕少师事达〖13〗，勤苦累年；达许教之者有年数矣，临当喻语而辄复止","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":34,"end":72},{"id":"wufan-q-b10642f71089ee702642","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-b321de26ddc32173ce49","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：盛云“君子志其大者，无所取诸”，故评家之旨，非新声也。其余所讥，则皆为非理。自中原酷乱，至于建安；数十年间，生民殆尽：比至小康，皆百死之余耳。江左虽有兵革，不能如中国之甚也；焉知达不算其安危，知祸有多少，利在东南，以全其身乎？而责不知魏氏将兴，流播吴越；在京房之筹，犹不能自免刑戮，况达但以秘术见薄，在悔吝之间乎！古之道术，盖非一方；探赜之功，岂惟六爻？苟得其要，则可以易而知之矣；回转一筹，胡足怪哉！达之推算，穷其要妙以知幽测隐，何愧于古？而以裨、梓限之，谓达为妄，非笃论也。","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":116,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fb85abd35bccd57b5d40","start":0,"end":245},{"id":"wufan-q-b9f045137bfd7b3217ce","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-107c2ef275bd39e731d3","layer":"original","quote":"自阚泽、殷礼皆名儒善士〖12〗，亲屈节就学：达秘而不告","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":6,"end":33},{"id":"wufan-q-c2a6a66b49d7207889d9","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-b1c1bc08a69e5ae5e3e0","layer":"original","quote":"用思精密","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":25},{"id":"wufan-q-ce6efcd3064c182902d2","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-e0df12163a7154d2aaba","layer":"original","quote":"或难达曰：“飞者固不可校〖5〗，谁知其然？此殆妄耳！”达使其人取小豆数斗，播之席上。立处其数〖6〗，验覆果信","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54},{"id":"wufan-q-d680e0b8134d7cb216b7","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-00d31326556c44b7cbcb","layer":"original","quote":"间居无为，引算自校〖5〗。乃叹曰：“吾算，讫尽某年月日，其终矣！”","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33},{"id":"wufan-q-d79501608da0ff644f94","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-a23a7a957e69ce5bb914","layer":"original","quote":"滕如期往，至，乃佯求索书〖20〗，惊言失之。云：“女婿昨来，必是渠所窃〖21〗！”遂从此绝。","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46},{"id":"wufan-q-de3b6b207aa735526d8c","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-c5889490acc554489cec","layer":"pei","quote":"令达算‘作天子之后，当复几年’？达曰：‘高祖建元十二年；陛下倍之。’权大喜，左右称‘万岁’。果如达言","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-23ae4ebce99532b82d2b","start":17,"end":67},{"id":"wufan-q-fbb749a8bc0ee66df7bf","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-5594b8fa211989854fd8","layer":"original","quote":"权问其法，达终不语；由此见薄，禄位不至","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":25,"end":44},{"id":"wuzhu-e-p042a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-f9b2d8cafa27af1b92ad","layer":"pei","quote":"魏文帝之在广陵，吴人大骇。乃临江为疑城，自石头至于江乘；车以木桢，衣以苇席，加采饰焉：一夕而成。魏人自江西望，甚惮之，遂退军。权令赵达算之，曰：‘曹丕走矣！虽然，吴衰庚子岁。’权曰：‘几何？’达屈指而计之，曰：‘五十八年。’权曰：‘今日之忧，不暇及远：此子孙事也！’","attribution":"干宝《晋纪》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":383,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f2364975efe3e0fa778d","start":12,"end":145},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p042","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-f9b2d8cafa27af1b92ad","layer":"pei","quote":"魏文帝之在广陵，吴人大骇。乃临江为疑城，自石头至于江乘；车以木桢，衣以苇席，加采饰焉：一夕而成。魏人自江西望，甚惮之，遂退军。权令赵达算之，曰：‘曹丕走矣！虽然，吴衰庚子岁。’权曰：‘几何？’达屈指而计之，曰：‘五十八年。’权曰：‘今日之忧，不暇及远：此子孙事也！’","attribution":"干宝《晋纪》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":383,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f2364975efe3e0fa778d","start":12,"end":145}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
